		<h1 class="gl-display">A librarian for your Zotero library</h1>
		<p class="lead">Sub-Sub tags, imports, repairs and reads your references, and helps you search the literature. It runs in your terminal, on your computer, with the AI model you choose. Nothing in your library changes until you say yes.</p>
		<div class="install-box">
			<p class="cmd-label">macOS and Linux</p>
			<pre class="cmd"><code>curl -fsSL https://subsub.tiagojacinto.eu/install.sh | sh</code></pre>
			<p class="cmd-label">Windows (PowerShell)</p>
			<pre class="cmd ps"><code>powershell -ExecutionPolicy ByPass -c "irm https://subsub.tiagojacinto.eu/install.ps1 | iex"</code></pre>
			<p class="small">Needs Zotero 10 and an account with an AI model provider. <a href="/install/">What the installer does, and other ways to install</a>.</p>
		</div>
