<section class="section">
	<h2>What you need</h2>
	<div class="cards three">
		<div class="card"><h3>Zotero 10</h3><p>Running on the same computer, with the local API turned on. Your library stays in Zotero; Sub-Sub reaches it only on your computer.</p></div>
		<div class="card"><h3>An AI model</h3><p>Any provider that <a href="https://pi.dev">pi</a> supports, with your own account. <a href="/models/">Tested models</a>.</p></div>
		<div class="card"><h3>A notes folder</h3><p>Plain Markdown files. An Obsidian vault works. Sub-Sub writes review notes and literature notes there.</p></div>
	</div>
	<blockquote>"This mere painstaking burrower and grub-worm of a poor devil of a Sub-Sub appears to have gone through the long Vaticans and street-stalls of the earth, picking up whatever random allusions to whales he could anyways find in any book whatsoever." (Moby-Dick, Extracts)</blockquote>
</section>
